### Unit Tests
- **MUST** test all environment configurations
- **MUST** verify environment detection logic
- **MUST** test environment-specific feature flags
- **MUST** test environment-specific error handling

### UI Tests
- **MUST** test environment badges display correctly
- **MUST** test environment info composable
- **MUST** verify environment-specific UI behavior
- **MUST** test environment switching

### Integration Tests
- **MUST** test Firebase services per environment
- **MUST** verify API endpoints per environment
- **MUST** test environment-specific configurations
- **MUST** verify environment-specific features

## Documentation Requirements

### Environment Setup Guide
- **MUST** create comprehensive environment setup documentation
- **MUST** document all environment configurations
- **MUST** provide troubleshooting guide
- **MUST** include migration instructions

### API Documentation
- **MUST** document environment-specific API endpoints
- **MUST** document environment-specific configurations
- **MUST** provide environment-specific examples
- **MUST** document security considerations

## Prohibited Practices

### Hardcoding
- **NEVER** hardcode environment-specific values
- **NEVER** use hardcoded API URLs
- **NEVER** hardcode Firebase project IDs
- **NEVER** hardcode environment-specific settings

### Environment Mixing
- **NEVER** mix environment configurations
- **NEVER** use production keys in development
- **NEVER** use development settings in production
- **NEVER** share environment-specific secrets

### Inconsistent Configuration
- **NEVER** use different configuration patterns per environment
- **NEVER** skip environment-specific configurations
- **NEVER** use default values for environment-specific settings
- **NEVER** ignore environment-specific requirements

